+2.  Scale render and GT tensors from $[0, 1]$ to $[-1, 1]$ via $x_{\text{scaled}} = 2.0 \cdot x - 1.0$ [S2, unofficial].
+3.  Add batch dimension with `unsqueeze(0)` [S2, unofficial].
+4.  Pass through model [S2, unofficial].
+5.  Return mean of output tensor as float [S2, unofficial].
 
 **Parameters:**
-*   `net`: "vgg" (specifies the VGG-16 backbone) [S2, unofficial].
-*   `normalize`: True (implicit in the scaling step) [S1][S2, unofficial].
+*   `net`: "vgg" (backbone architecture for perceptual features) [S2, unofficial].
